  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max decides to fix his mistake by making a fake phone call. He calls the restaurant hostess Angelina, pretending to be from the Milan trade show. Let's listen to his brilliant plan in Russian.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Бонжорно, синьоры.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Добрый день, ресторан Клод Моне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Меня зовут Александр.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Выставка отменяется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Передайте это Виктории.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Хорошо, я передам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Граци, синьора, чао-чао.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Да, алло. Виктория Сергеевна, здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Звонил представитель выставки из Милана.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Он сказал, что она отменяется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "А, правда? Я уже в Домодедово.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Я чуть не улетела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Спасибо, что предупредили.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the exchange around A Call from Milan line by line and unpack how the Russian works.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Бонжорно, синьоры.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Buongiorno, signori.' Max puts on a fake accent. He greets the staff in Italian to sound convincing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Добрый день, ресторан Клод Моне.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good afternoon, Claude Monet restaurant.' Angelina answers professionally. She states the restaurant's name clearly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Меня зовут Александр.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My name is Alexander.' Max introduces his fabricated persona. He gives himself a generic name.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Выставка отменяется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The exhibition is cancelled.' He delivers the fake bad news. Max claims the entire event has been called off.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Передайте это Виктории.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pass this on to Victoria.' He makes sure the message reaches his target. Max specifically asks her to tell Vika.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Хорошо, я передам.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All right, I will pass it on.' Angelina accepts the message without suspicion. She promises to relay the information.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Граци, синьора, чао-чао.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Grazie, signora, ciao-ciao.' Max signs off in character. He throws in a few more Italian words for good measure.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Да, алло. Виктория Сергеевна, здравствуйте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, hello. Victoria Sergeyevna, hello.' Angelina calls Vika to deliver the news. She starts with a polite greeting.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Звонил представитель выставки из Милана.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A representative of the exhibition from Milan called.' She passes on the fabricated story. Angelina reports that the organizers called.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "angelina_h",
      "t": "Он сказал, что она отменяется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He said that it is cancelled.' She relays the crucial detail. Angelina tells Vika the trip is off.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "А, правда? Я уже в Домодедово.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, really? I am already in Domodedovo.' Vika is shocked by the sudden change. She mentions she is already at the airport.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Я чуть не улетела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I almost flew away.' Vika realizes how close she came to leaving. She notes that she nearly boarded the plane.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Спасибо, что предупредили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for warning me.' She expresses gratitude for the timely update. Vika genuinely appreciates the heads-up. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Бонжорно, синьоры.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
