      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max's crazy plan actually worked, and Vika is heading back to the restaurant. Let's see what happens next. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'signora' and 'kind' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
